# Keeps this multi-GB build directory out of both the Docker build context
# and CDK's DockerImageAsset staging copy (infra/lib/rtmp-service-stack.ts)
# — without this, every `cdk synth`/test run copies whatever's currently in
# target/ (which a concurrent local `cargo build` can be actively rewriting,
# a real race that intermittently fails asset staging with an ENOENT).
target/
